  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Prevention and Peace Forum Social Science Research Council</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to CPPF enhance knowledge and expertise relating to conflict prevention, conflict management, peacebuilding, and peacekeeping. CPPF is currently working to support processes relating to United Nations Integrated Transition Assistance Mission in Sudan (UNITAMS), regional strategies in the Horn and Great Lakes regions, the Resident Coordinators in the MENA region. CPPF currently supports the Climate Security Mechanism and the United Nations Development Programme. They also contribute to policy formation in thematic areas such as the Women Peace and Security agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
